WEBVTT

00:06:57.663 --> 00:07:01.208
Those are the people
who have the lived experience,

00:07:01.250 --> 00:07:05.796
who can best advise on climate adaptation
and resilience planning.

00:07:06.172 --> 00:07:09.967
Now, if their perspectives
had been known and integrated

00:07:10.009 --> 00:07:14.805
into the inter-agency
emergency response planning

00:07:14.847 --> 00:07:18.184
in New Orleans for Hurricane Katrina,

00:07:18.225 --> 00:07:22.062
then thousands of families would not
have been stranded on their roofs,

00:07:22.104 --> 00:07:23.731
waiting for rescue

00:07:23.772 --> 00:07:25.774
or sleeping in a sports stadium,

00:07:25.816 --> 00:07:28.527
because the city would have already known

00:07:28.569 --> 00:07:31.655
that lower-income families
living in a flood zone